{
  "about": "Shared excerpt vectors (EVX-1, vision 43 section 6.2). The excerpt is the bytes from the first byte of start_line through the last byte of end_line, that line's newline included when it has one, with no normalization. sha256 is Review Kit's SpanRef.ContentHash formula over the excerpt: lowercase hex of SHA-256, no prefix. start_line = end_line = 0 is the whole file (SpanRef: zero lines mean the whole file). A vector with ok false is a range the file does not hold.",
